repository-code: "https://github.com/Starlight-Unit-Studio/Quantum-CoreOS"
url: "https://github.com/Starlight-Unit-Studio/Quantum-CoreOS"
abstract: >-
  Quantum CoreOS is the operating-system integration project of Starlight Unit
  Studios. The current repository is a planning and integration baseline that
  defines the future relationship between Quantum Runtime, Quantum Control,
  the TCI layer and the Quantum Shell before bootable OS images are produced.
keywords:
  - operating system
  - AI-first computing
  - system integration
  - Starlight Unit Studios
